flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Load saved data]
    B --> C[Display menu]
    C --> D{User choice}
    D -->|Add book| E[Enter book details]
    D -->|Display| F[Show all books]
    D -->|Search| G[Search by ID or title]
    D -->|Issue| H[Check availability and issue]
    D -->|Return| I[Verify record and return]
    D -->|Issued list| J[Show active issue records]
    E --> K[Save data]
    H --> K
    I --> K
    F --> C
    G --> C
    J --> C
    K --> C
    D -->|Exit| L[Save data]
    L --> M([End])
